<BaseLayout title="What We Help With | Healing the Heart">
<section class="page-hero"><div class="page-hero-inner"><p class="eyebrow">You may recognize yourself here</p><h1>What we help with</h1><p>You don't need the perfect words for what hurts. Sometimes we simply know that something inside us is not okay.</p></div></section>
<section class="section"><div class="rich-section"><h2>Sometimes pain changes the way we live.</h2><p>Unresolved wounds can affect the way we think, feel, relate, trust, receive love, and protect ourselves. This journey creates space to understand those places without shame.</p><ul class="list-clean">{topics.map(topic=><li>{topic}</li>)}</ul><p>Recognizing yourself in these words does not mean you are broken beyond repair. It means there may be something worth bringing into the light.</p></div></section>
<section class="statement-band"><p>What happened to you matters. You don't have to carry it alone.</p></section>
</BaseLayout>
